OL,3,GNEWSABishop in bullying case suspended
OL,4,Aagain just months before retiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's first female bishop has been
OL,7,Fsuspended again, just months before she
OL,8,Fis due to retire.
OL,10,FThe Right Reverend Anne Dyer, the
OL,11,FScottish Episcopal Church's Bishop of
OL,12,FAberdeen and Orkney, was suspended in
OL,13,F2022 after being accused of bullying.
OL,15,FThe church's independent procurator
OL,16,Freviewed the evidence and decided it
OL,17,Fwas not in the public interest to
OL,18,Fpursue matters any further. She
OL,19,Freturned to work, but announced earlier
OL,20,Fthis year that she would be retiring
OL,21,Fnext February at the age of 70.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
