OL,3,GNEWSABishop in bullying case suspended
OL,4,Aagain just months before retiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has now been suspended over a
OL,7,Fcomplaint which is separate to the
OL,8,Fearlier case. She said in a statement
OL,9,Fshe was "surprised".
